24
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:52,280
Forbidden Area
Soul Refining Sect

25
00:01:58,360 --> 00:02:00,070
Little friend Ceng Niu,

26
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,390
you're finally back.

27
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:05,430
This place

28
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:08,800
is the Soul Refining Sect's forbidden area.

29
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:12,030
Only those who have mastered Soul Sealing

30
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,550
can enter it.

31
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:15,480
Death aura...

32
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,750
He's at the end of his lifespan...

33
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:19,840
Senior...you...

34
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,920
It's alright.

35
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:24,430
I still have a few years left.

36
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,710
I won’t die too soon.

37
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:29,520
I must thank Senior

38
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:31,080
regarding the Soul Flag.

39
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,910
It's fine as long as it helped you.

40
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,510
In these short years,

41
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:37,320
your cultivation level has increased a lot.

42
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:40,160
You're already at the point where you need to absorb

43
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:42,680
celestial spiritual energy to refine your body.

44
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,030
This old man

45
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:47,230
can lend you a hand with that.

46
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:54,870
But this help

47
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:57,030
comes with a price.

48
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,520
Senior, please speak.

49
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:06,600
These tablets are from all the past Soul Transformation cultivators of the sect.

50
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:08,910
I entrust the Soul Refining Sect to you

51
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:12,030
in front of all the ancestors.

52
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:15,430
And what I ask of you in return

53
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:19,310
is that you protect the Billion-Soul Flag.

54
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,320
As long as it exists,

55
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:23,670
the Soul Refining Sect will live.

56
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,950
This planet is too small

57
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:28,670
to hold someone like you, Ceng Niu.

58
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:31,440
When you leave this place one day,

59
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:33,030
you must find a place suitable

60
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:34,910
for our Soul Refining Sect.

61
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,990
You must also build 999 heaven-reaching towers

62
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,310
to fulfill our sect's dream

63
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,230
by making us

64
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:44,790
a rank 6 cultivation country !

65
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:50,320
I accept.

66
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:58,750
Senior Brother,

67
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:02,630
I have gambled everything on your divination.

68
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:04,430
I hope that

69
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,990
this gamble will pay off in the end.

70
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,510
Our reserves of celestial jades

71
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:13,630
aren't enough for your Soul Transformation.

72
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:16,550
I'll take you to gather more celestial jades.

73
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:18,920
Are there other places

74
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:20,920
besides the Celestial Realm ?

75
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:23,270
Friends will help us.

76
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:30,120
Demonic Insect Sect

77
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:32,710
Mice of the Demonic Insect Sect,

78
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:35,750
your grandfather Du Tian has come !

79
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:38,030
Quickly hand over the celestial jades !

80
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,800
Yan Hong
Demonic Insect Sect Ancestor
Early stage Soul Transformation

81
00:04:45,070 --> 00:04:47,960
Cha Zi
Demonic Insect Sect Ancestor
Early stage Soul Transformation

82
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,840
Old ghost Du Tian,

83
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:48,190
there are no more celestial jades !

84
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:49,630
Really ?

85
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:56,430
Give me the celestial jades

86
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:57,910
and I'll leave.

87
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,270
If you don't,

88
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,550
I won't fight you,

89
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:04,350
but I'll kill all the insects of this swamp.

90
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:07,150
I'll exterminate them all !

91
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:10,360
The Soul Refining Sect are all crazy.

92
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,750
When their lifespan is almost up,

93
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:13,070
they fearlessly

94
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,760
use this Soul Flag

95
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,990
to steal celestial jades...

96
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,320
Old ghost,

97
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,770
if you dare attack,

98
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:24,370
the Junior beside you

99
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:25,310
will die for sure !

100
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:31,870
Do you

101
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:35,150
still think I will die today ?

102
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:42,910
How can a Soul Formation cultivator have a celestial artifact ?

103
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,990
Who the hell are you !?

104
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:45,910
I am

105
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,630
Ceng Niu.

106
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:51,480
He's the one that killed Li Yuanfeng and the Giant Demon Ancestor

107
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:53,350
while at Soul Formation, Ceng Niu !

108
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:54,630
Enough talk.

109
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,120
Same rules,

110
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,630
give me half of your celestial jades.

111
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:00,830
Take them

112
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,110
and don't ever come back !

113
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:05,800
See ?

114
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:08,470
I told you friends would help us.

115
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:14,430
Last time, my master stole a lot from them

116
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:16,470
yet they still have this many left !

117
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,200
However...

118
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:19,790
It's still not enough.

119
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:21,720
It doesn't matter.

120
00:06:21,770 --> 00:06:23,600
If one isn't enough, rob two.

121
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,080
If two aren't enough, rob three !

122
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:28,310
With the Billion-Soul Flag in hand,

123
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:30,590
we can go all around the planet.

124
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:32,710
Let's go,

125
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:33,670
next target !

126
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:37,040
The Soul Refining Sect

127
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,510
really is something.

128
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:05,350
Alright,

129
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,750
these celestial jades should suffice.

130
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:10,630
If you need more later,

131
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:13,110
you must steal them yourself.

132
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,840
Little friend Ceng Niu,

133
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:17,070
remember this.

134
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:18,750
In the cultivation world,

135
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:21,550
the best way to get celestial jades is to steal them.

136
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,400
In the future,

137
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:26,110
you must take the Billion-Soul Flag and do the same.

138
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:29,630
Don't tarnish our Soul Refining Sect's reputation !

139
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:30,760
Okay.

140
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,760
But either you steal everything

141
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:34,280
or you steal nothing !

142
00:07:36,840 --> 00:07:38,390
Good, good, good.

143
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:42,270
But planet Suzaku is too small.

144
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:44,630
In my youth,

145
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:46,750
I once visited Planet Tian Yun.

146
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:49,430
It's 10 times larger than planet Suzaku,

147
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,150
has many sects

148
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,790
and abundant resources.

149
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,710
If not for my lack of strength,

150
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,870
I'd have plundered it !

151
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,590
It would've been thrilling.

152
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,560
Planet Tian Yun...

153
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:06,280
The All-Seer lives on planet Tian Yun.

154
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,440
His cultivation is unfathomable

155
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:10,630
He is rumored to hold a position

156
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:12,830
in the Cultivation Alliance.

157
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:16,190
He is far beyond our insignificant Zhuque Zi.

158
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,870
I am the All-Seer.

159
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:23,670
If you can leave this waste of a planet,

160
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,840
then come find me on planet Tian Yun

161
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:27,590
to become my honorary disciple

162
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:29,990
and follow me for 100 years.

163
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:32,960
Once I have settled things on planet Suzaku,

164
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:35,230
I must go to Planet Tian Yun.

165
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,620
It's the Forsaken Immortal Clan,

166
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:50,640
they're heading for the Suzaku Continent.

167
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:54,470
I didn't expect a second attack so soon.

168
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:56,720
Let's not get involved

169
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:58,480
and quickly return to the sect.

170
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,870
The Soul Refining Sect...

171
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,030
Mu Ye,

172
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,630
go meet up with Junior Patriarch,

173
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,470
I'll catch up with you.

174
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,600
Understood.

175
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:32,470
You two from the Soul Refining Sect,

176
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:38,640
Cui Zhi
Fifth Ancestor of the
Forsaken Immortal Clan 
9-Leaf Shaman

177
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,550
