178
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:42,390
A 9-Leaf Shaman...

179
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:45,470
I heard that in the great war thousands of years ago,

180
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:50,200
your Soul Refining Sect dominated the battlefield with the Billion-Soul Flag.

181
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,830
Let me see

182
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,920
if the power of this artifact

183
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:56,000
is real

184
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,030
or not !

185
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,910
You aren't worthy of the Billion Soul Flag.

186
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:02,590
However...

187
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:04,510
Little friend Ceng Niu,

188
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:07,030
the sects we robbed before

189
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:08,470
were just small fry.

190
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,070
Take this chance

191
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:13,030
to witness the true power

192
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:15,310
of the Billion-Soul Flag.

193
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,710
Watch closely !

194
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,670
500 million souls,

195
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,790
13 primary souls,

196
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:23,670
come out !

197
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:25,630
Remember,

198
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:27,590
the essence

199
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,720
of the Billion-Soul Flag's power

200
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:32,430
is merging.

201
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:35,990
There is no fixed method of using it.

202
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:38,960
Formation,

203
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:39,630
activate !

204
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:43,270
The 6th generation ancestor excelled in formations.

205
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:45,430
In his hands, this flag

206
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:47,670
became a tool for formations.

207
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:49,190
Thirteen Souls Formation...

208
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,310
Soul Refining !

209
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,950
This formation can extract souls ?

210
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:08,510
Interesting.

211
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:11,880
Break !

212
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:21,710
Glass Cauldrons !

213
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:26,510
Refine !

214
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:30,350
A 9-Leaf Shaman

215
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:32,590
is equivalent to Early stage Ascendant.

216
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:35,230
He isn't weak.

217
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:37,550
Is this all

218
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:40,950
the Billion-Soul Flag can do ?

219
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:45,990
Do you know why the Billion-Soul Flag

220
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:49,750
is feared even by Ascendants ?

221
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,590
I will show it to you today !

222
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:58,070
The 10th ancestor's domain was devouring.

223
00:11:58,480 --> 00:11:59,630
In his hands,

224
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,830
